o-e-o019","title":"马超具表羕辞收羕付有司","time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuliao-q-f473a6f7cdb981bbf2a6"]},"order":7263,"participants":[{"person":"wudi-p0282","role":"羁旅归国常怀危惧、闻羕言大惊默然不答、羕退具表羕辞","evidence":["liuliao-q-f473a6f7cdb981bbf2a6"]},{"person":"xianzhu-p0064","role":"被收付有司者","evidence":["liuliao-q-f473a6f7cdb981bbf2a6"]}],"accounts":[]},{"id":"liuliao-e-o020","title":"彭羕狱中致诸葛亮书自陈本心","time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuliao-q-4c8e1c06b65a4c4df7ca"]},"order":7265,"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0064","role":"狱中与书自陈","evidence":["liuliao-q-4c8e1c06b65a4c4df7ca"]},{"person":"zhuge-liang","role":"受书者","evidence":["liuliao-q-4c8e1c06b65a4c4df7ca"]}],"accounts":[]},{"id":"liuliao-e-o021","title":"彭羕竟诛死年三十七","time":{"label":"原文纪年见引文；不换算公元年","precision":"undated","basis":"本批仅记录原文时间表达，不由相邻纪年推算公元年。","evidence":["liuliao-q-1abf03ff9d9e4599676d"]},"order":7266,"participants":[{"person":"xianzhu-p0064","role":"竟诛死、时年三十七","evidence":["liuliao-q-1abf03ff9d9e4599676d"]}],"accounts":[]}],"persons":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0064","name":"彭羕","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o043","liuliao-q-20caedd4a9cadd6c705a","liuliao-q-3b7a9e93a3b9f1ecd54a","liuliao-q-ca0ac8de1d6d3dd403d1","liuliao-q-247aa16b17cb71d0c513","liuliao-q-f614c7ec3598ca418de3","liuliao-q-39819a07158711985dc5","liuliao-q-f473a6f7cdb981bbf2a6","liuliao-q-4c8e1c06b65a4c4df7ca","liuliao-q-1abf03ff9d9e4599676d"],"facts":[],"aliases":[],"mentions":[{"id":"xianzhu-m-o043-xianzhu-p0064","kind":"mention","text":"文中提及","evidence":["xianzhu-q-o043"]},{"id":"liuliao-m-dc074672ab63869708f7","kind":"mention","text":"本段涉及彭羕","evidence":["liuliao-q-d9665bbb91f9df502fd4","liuliao-q-325e45e613fe050212ff","liuliao-q-786cd608654a686a0b2e"]}]}],"evidence":[{"id":"liuliao-q-20caedd4a9cadd6c705a","section":"chapter-040","block":"b-62685cfcf25eb40f88cd","layer":"original","quote":"彭羕字永年，广汉人。身长八尺，容貌甚伟。姿性骄傲，多所轻忽；惟敬同郡秦子敕〖1〗，荐之于太守许靖曰：“昔高宗梦傅说〖2〗，周文求吕尚〖3〗；爰及汉祖，纳食其于布衣〖4〗。此乃帝王之所以倡业垂统〖5〗，缉熙厥功也〖6〗。今明府稽古皇极〖7〗，允执神灵〖8〗；体公刘之德〖9〗，行勿践之惠〖10〗；《清庙》之作于是乎始〖11〗，褒贬之义于是乎兴。然而六翮未之备也〖12〗。伏见处士绵竹秦宓：膺山甫之德〖13〗，履隽生之直〖14〗；枕石漱流，吟咏缊袍〖15〗；偃息于仁义之途〖16〗，恬淡于浩然之域；高概节行，守真不亏。虽古人潜遁，蔑以加旃〖17〗！若明府能招致此人，必有忠谠落落之誉〖18〗，丰功厚利，建迹（之）〔立〕勋；然后纪功于王府，飞声于来世。不亦美哉！”","section_title":"刘彭廖李刘魏杨传第十","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0086.xhtml","index":80,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":329,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{"xianzhu-p0064":{"fields":[{"id":"xianzhu-p0064-directory-courtesy","key":"courtesy","label":"字","text":"永年","evidence":["liuliao-q-20caedd4a9cadd6c705a"]}],"directory":{"faction":"shu"}}},"directory_counts":{}}
